  "body": "## Summary\n\n```text\ndoc/2026-11-08T11-08-53Z_design_id5813_relay_proxy_protocol/\n└── 2026-11-08T11-08-53Z_design_id5813_relay_proxy_protocol.md\nplanning/architecture/README.md  # index\n```\n\n- Chooses an ID-aware opaque relay service with separate lookup and home-relay roles, independent multi-home leases, honest hop/application receipts, volatile delivery, finite backpressure, and edge-local state.\n- Keeps #2036 application semantics and parent/sibling wire choices intact; records the #5795 and #5815 security boundaries.\n\nCloses #5813\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** #5813 was open without a decision-record PR.\n  **After:** the dated record covers the requested roles, multi-relay behavior, delivery/retention, quotas, scaling, alternatives, and invariants.\n- `git diff --cached --check` passed; an isolated Python check confirmed the architecture-index link resolves.\n- Docs-only/class-0 per `.github/ci-policy.md`; no code build/test suite applies.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** Two-way\n\nA later dated design record can supersede this decision; the PR changes documentation only.\n\n**Blast Radius:** Documentation\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796728401&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7653&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7653&signature=50830655bf1022bc4946596356bb4b11d8d3c9dc120eecb10c9096bd7d9b774d\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a 